      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLD BUTTON (5) scored (20.64) last time out at this track and returns here after four months. Has a good overall strike-rate and looks a key player. ZIPPING MARIE (2) jumps from box 2 for the first time after scoring at this track (20.00) in a Grade 5. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course and distance. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Sure to measure up. PAINTED BEAUTY (1) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 6th at Wentworth Park in Grade 5 company. Great chance to atone. BALLET BELLE (8) drops in journey and warrants respect.",
